#: ../../source/libraries/physics/index.md:3
msgid ""
"**miniworlds-physics** adds rigid-body physics to miniworlds via "
"[pymunk](http://www.pymunk.org/). Replace `World` with `PhysicsWorld` and"
" every actor gains an `actor.physics` interface for controlling mass, "
"velocity, elasticity, friction, and collision callbacks."
